{"id":"30584c32b5f9ed53","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-T-schema-extension.md","title":"UTB把闭句去引号统一到带参数公式","display":"lem-T-schema-extension — UTB把闭句去引号统一到带参数公式","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-T-schema-extension","aliases":["91-lem-T-schema-extension"],"display":"lem-T-schema-extension — UTB把闭句去引号统一到带参数公式","depends_on":["[[91-df-TB]]","[[91-df-UTB]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-T-schema-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-T-schema-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-T-schema-extension — UTB把闭句去引号统一到带参数公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6018cc1b13710826\" href=\"?note=6018cc1b13710826\" title=\"91-df-TB\">91-df-TB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f215d3f10d33ae6\" href=\"?note=2f215d3f10d33ae6\" title=\"91-df-UTB\">91-df-UTB</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-T-schema-extension-—-UTB-把闭句去引号统一到带参数公式\">lem-T-schema-extension — UTB 把闭句去引号统一到带参数公式</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB}\\)</span> (逐句与一致去引号理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> (基础语言句子与公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\\)</span> (数码代入函数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\forall\\psi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\left[\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\psi(\\vec x)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\forall\\psi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\left[\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\psi(\\vec x)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>特别地，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>所以同一算术基底上的 UTB 包含 TB 的闭句实例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一致化发生在自由变量与参数层面，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 仍是基础语言公式。UTB 不把\nT-schema 扩展到任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 公式，也不因此获得说谎者或嵌套\n真理句的无条件双条件。</p>\n<p>标准 TB 与 UTB 都对 PA 的算术语言保守；表达上的统一性不等于算术\n证明论强度严格增加。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-T-schema-extension-—-UTB-把闭句去引号统一到带参数公式","text":"lem-T-schema-extension — UTB 把闭句去引号统一到带参数公式","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-substitution-function","status":"resolved","id":"95643c507a4d6dc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-substitution-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}extension}\\vdash\n\\forall\\psi(\\vec x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\vdash\n\\forall\\vec x\\,\n\\left[\nT\\!\\left(\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\vec x}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner},\\vec x)\n\\right)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\psi(\\vec x)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{TB}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{UTB}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr)\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false}],"bytes":1652,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-T-schema-extension]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-lem-T-schema-extension]]"}],"outgoing":["6018cc1b13710826","2f215d3f10d33ae6","95643c507a4d6dc3","822ef14bbd4e020d"]}